import{_ as t,o as a,c as i,a2 as r}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 203 | Cross-Boundary Energy Transformation Law: Realm-Wide Dispatch of Origin Three-Basic","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 203 | Cross-Boundary Energy Transformation Law: Realm-Wide Dispatch of Origin Three-Basic","no":203,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Cross-Boundary Energy","Energy Transformation","Origin Three-Basic","Realm-Wide Dispatch"],"related":["15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law","11-Deduction Iteration System","12-Life Cycle System","13-Space Jurisprudence Dispatching System"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0203_模块1-跨境能量转化法则-本源三基全境调度.md","filePath":"en/0203_模块1-跨境能量转化法则-本源三基全境调度.md"}'),n={name:"en/0203_模块1-跨境能量转化法则-本源三基全境调度.md"};function o(s,e,l,c,d,h){return a(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[r('<h1 id="entry-203-cross-boundary-energy-transformation-law-realm-wide-dispatch-of-origin-three-basic" tabindex="-1">Entry 203 | Cross-Boundary Energy Transformation Law: Realm-Wide Dispatch of Origin Three-Basic <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-203-cross-boundary-energy-transformation-law-realm-wide-dispatch-of-origin-three-basic" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 203 | Cross-Boundary Energy Transformation Law: Realm-Wide Dispatch of Origin Three-Basic&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 15, 11, 12, 13</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-energy-does-not-disappear-it-only-gets-wrongly-stuck" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Energy does not disappear, it only gets wrongly stuck <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-energy-does-not-disappear-it-only-gets-wrongly-stuck" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Energy does not disappear, it only gets wrongly stuck&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Every cultivation bottleneck is ultimately an energy-transformation bottleneck: Sense Origin is &quot;cannot suck in,&quot; Transform Origin is &quot;cannot convert out,&quot; Law Origin is &quot;cannot merge with laws,&quot; Boundary-Breaking is &quot;cannot cross planes.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou summarizes cross-category, cross-plane, cross-layer energy transformation laws as the &quot;cross-boundary energy transformation law,&quot; and dispatches it realm-wide by the Origin Three-Basic (deduction iteration, life cycle, space jurisprudence dispatch). This entry explains how this law runs through the nine realms.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are the ethical base of cross-boundary transformation: the anti-predation axiom requires transformation to develop increments not extract stock; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires energy dispatch to benefit Myriad Races not some race&#39;s private occupation; the collective ascension axiom requires high-position energy to nourish downward, low-position achievements to feed back upward; the causal self-discipline axiom requires cross-plane energy flow to leave traces and file; the law-first axiom requires transformation formulas to be stable and self-consistent, not change numbers with plot; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-three-directions-of-cross-boundary" tabindex="-1">I. Three Directions of &quot;Cross-Boundary&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-directions-of-cross-boundary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three Directions of &quot;Cross-Boundary&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;Cross-boundary&quot; refers to three types of crossing:</p><ol><li><strong>Cross-type</strong>: transformation among spiritual qi ↔ magical power ↔ law power (Transform–Law Origin core).</li><li><strong>Cross-layer</strong>: flow among material plane ↔ energy layer ↔ consciousness domain ↔ law network (Boundary-Breaking–Origin core).</li><li><strong>Cross-plane</strong>: energy dispatch between different material planes (Boundary-Breaking Realm and above).</li></ol><h2 id="ii-realm-wide-division-of-labor-of-origin-three-basic" tabindex="-1">II. Realm-Wide Division of Labor of Origin Three-Basic <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-realm-wide-division-of-labor-of-origin-three-basic" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Realm-Wide Division of Labor of Origin Three-Basic&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Three-Basic happen to manage the three cross-boundary directions:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Origin Three-Basic</th><th>Primary Cross-Boundary</th><th>Core Realm Projection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Deduction Iteration (set 1)</td><td>Cross-type: computing optimal transformation path</td><td>Initial glimpse → Origin</td></tr><tr><td>Life Cycle (set 2)</td><td>Cross-layer: benign circulation of energy and life</td><td>Sense-birth → Source-birth</td></tr><tr><td>Space Jurisprudence Dispatch (set 3)</td><td>Cross-plane: precise dispatch of space and plane membranes</td><td>Space-awareness → Source-space</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The three synergize to constitute complete cross-boundary dispatch capability. Cultivating only one will hit a ceiling in some direction.</p><h2 id="iii-realm-wide-transformation-nodes" tabindex="-1">III. Realm-Wide Transformation Nodes <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-realm-wide-transformation-nodes" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Realm-Wide Transformation Nodes&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Realm Segment</th><th>Cross-Boundary Transformation Task</th><th>Three-Basic Synergy Mode</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sense–Condensed</td><td>Sucking in free energy, establishing internal circulation</td><td>Life cycle as foundation</td></tr><tr><td>Transform Origin Realm</td><td>Energy cross-type transformation</td><td>Deduction iteration seeks optimal formula</td></tr><tr><td>Law Origin Realm</td><td>Energy–law fusion generating magical power</td><td>Three-basic initial synergy</td></tr><tr><td>Dao Origin Realm</td><td>Personal Dao&#39;s energetic self-consistency</td><td>Deduction iteration systematized</td></tr><tr><td>Dao Integration Realm</td><td>Intradomain energy circulation self-consistent</td><td>Life cycle primarily manages</td></tr><tr><td>Boundary-Breaking Realm</td><td>Cross-plane energy not dissipating</td><td>Space jurisprudence dispatch primarily manages</td></tr><tr><td>World-Creation Realm</td><td>New world&#39;s energy circulation design</td><td>Three-basic full synergy</td></tr><tr><td>Origin Realm</td><td>Law-network-level energy dispatch</td><td>Three-basic unified</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="iv-transformation-efficiency-and-loss" tabindex="-1">IV. Transformation Efficiency and Loss <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-transformation-efficiency-and-loss" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Transformation Efficiency and Loss&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per &quot;Energy Cycle and Transformation Law&quot; (Document 15), every transformation has loss. Symbiotic civilization&#39;s goal is not to eliminate loss (that violates energy conservation), but <strong>to reduce loss to the engineering limit</strong>:</p><ul><li>The Multiplication Fruit&#39;s multi-stage resonance purification greatly reduces absorption–purification loss;</li><li>Deduction iteration pre-computes the optimal path for every transformation, avoiding trial-and-error waste;</li><li>Space jurisprudence dispatch lets cross-plane flow avoid the high-loss &quot;tearing&quot; old road.</li></ul><p>The predatory route&#39;s transformation efficiency is low precisely because it additionally pays loss that should not exist on &quot;refining residual traces.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-public-nature-of-energy-dispatch" tabindex="-1">V. Public Nature of Energy Dispatch <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-public-nature-of-energy-dispatch" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Public Nature of Energy Dispatch&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cross-boundary energy dispatch at high ranks is not a private skill but a public function. Strong ones above Boundary-Breaking dispatching plane energy must leave Alaya traces and joint-contracting bookkeeping — every increment you dispatch must be returned per contribution, not taken as private. This is the anti-predation axiom&#39;s landing in energetics: energy may be dispatched by strong ones, but dispatch power does not equal ownership.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: three-basic synergy compresses transformation loss to the engineering limit, the same energy travels farther</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: dispatch power ≠ ownership, cross-boundary energy may not extract other races&#39; stock</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style energy transformation relies on attribute countering and devouring residual traces, huge loss; Heng Yuan Zhou relies on three-basic synergy, clean and efficient</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: three-basic and transformation formulas are open to the five genealogies, each race combines per its traits</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: transformation formulas, dispatch protocols, and loss-control engineering are all public</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-network-settlement-of-energy-dispatch" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Network Settlement of Energy Dispatch <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-network-settlement-of-energy-dispatch" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Network Settlement of Energy Dispatch&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The cross-boundary energy transformation law and Origin Three-Basic&#39;s realm-wide dispatch have their execution platform in the Alaya Network&#39;s distributed computation layer. Heng Yuan Zhou takes the Origin Three-Basic — energy, information, karma — as three basic parameters for cross-realm dispatch; the network balances their proportions in real time, preventing any parameter from overloading. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s joint contracting system manifests here: whoever dispatches energy producing civilizational increments receives the corresponding weight allocation. The law-first axiom requires dispatch to proceed within the law framework, not allowing cross-realm forced seizure. The universal equal infinite law ensures dispatch does not favor high-realm individuals; resources always flow to where civilizational increments are greatest.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The cross-boundary energy transformation law turns &quot;how energy flows&quot; from metaphysics into engineering. The Origin Three-Basic each manage one direction and synergize realm-wide; this is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s technical answer in energetics to &quot;how to become strong without predation.&quot;</p><p>In the final analysis, cross-boundary energy transformation law · realm-wide dispatch of Origin Three-Basic described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./15-能量循环与转化法则.html">15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law</a> · <a href="./11-推演迭代体系详解.html">11-Deduction Iteration System</a> · <a href="./12-生命循环体系详解.html">12-Life Cycle System</a> · <a href="./13-空间法理调度体系详解.html">13-Space Jurisprudence Dispatching System</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const p=t(n,[["render",o]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
